43:32.055 --> 43:35.999
Mayor Guthrie reached out to me on November 7th,

43:36.127 --> 43:39.039
as he's done occasionally during the term of council,

43:39.167 --> 43:42.991
for written advice that we are allowed to provide to members of

43:43.023 --> 43:46.471
council. Mayor Guthrie disclosed to me that he had been made

43:46.503 --> 43:49.819
aware of an article in

43:49.867 --> 43:53.691
the Vancouver sun, and he attached a copy of the article which

43:53.803 --> 43:58.179
recounted an Ethics Commissioner report

43:58.307 --> 44:01.855
from the City of New Westminster in bc.

44:02.155 --> 44:06.135
In that particular instance, the Ethics Commissioner

44:06.715 --> 44:10.435
was investigating a complaint that the Mayor of New

44:10.475 --> 44:14.507
Westminster had accepted gifts and benefits

44:14.611 --> 44:17.803
in contravention of the community charter,

44:17.899 --> 44:21.263
which is akin to the Municipality municipal act in B.C.

44:21.439 --> 44:25.167
and the code of conduct for the city. What did the mayor do

44:25.191 --> 44:29.875
in New Westminster? He accepted travel accommodation.

44:30.455 --> 44:33.615
Sorry? Travel accommodation and

44:33.775 --> 44:37.143
meals from an entity known as the

44:37.199 --> 44:40.871
Global Covenant of Mayors. In attending

44:40.983 --> 44:44.535
a local climate action summit in Dubai In

44:44.575 --> 44:48.697
December of 2023, Mayor Guthrie

44:48.881 --> 44:52.769
forthrightly disclosed to me that he had attended

44:52.897 --> 44:56.481
the same conference and asked me for advice as

44:56.513 --> 45:00.385
to whether he had breached anything in the code of conduct

45:00.505 --> 45:04.489
for the City of Guelph. I said to him, I will read the

45:04.537 --> 45:08.377
report from the Ethics Commissioner and I will get back to you.

45:08.521 --> 45:12.369
I provided my written advice to the mayor on November

45:12.497 --> 45:16.505
9th. So that was two days after he had requested it.

45:16.625 --> 45:20.773
The mayor fully disclosed to me that he had attended the

45:20.909 --> 45:24.261
conference. In fact, I recently found out

45:24.293 --> 45:27.781
that he also posted on social media he

45:27.813 --> 45:32.425
did not hide the fact that he was attending the conference.

45:32.925 --> 45:36.581
He Also indicated to me that he is part

45:36.653 --> 45:39.693
of the Global COvenant of Mayors,

45:39.789 --> 45:43.749
GCOM, the Canadian cohort, and he is

45:43.837 --> 45:48.285
a director of the North

45:48.325 --> 45:50.905
American Board of Directors of.

45:52.705 --> 45:56.209
And I took that in. I requested that the Mayor

45:56.257 --> 46:01.353
provide me with some additional clarification.

46:01.529 --> 46:05.137
I asked if council was aware of his appointment,

46:05.201 --> 46:09.193
if council had endorsed it, if council had supported it, if council had

46:09.249 --> 46:13.445
appointed him to be appointed the Mayor again,

46:13.785 --> 46:17.369
I thought in full and frank discussion, indicated to me that he did

46:17.417 --> 46:21.169
not believe any of that was the case, but that he joined this

46:21.297 --> 46:24.945
organization because. Because it's an organization of mayors.

46:25.445 --> 46:28.745
The same instance that happened in New Westminster.

46:29.085 --> 46:32.029
I reviewed the report of the Ethics Commissioner,

46:32.077 --> 46:36.173
New Westminster, and her conclusion was

46:36.349 --> 46:39.997
that the accommodation, the travel

46:40.061 --> 46:43.917
expenses and the meals, but not the conference

46:44.021 --> 46:47.265
attendance per se, the conference attendance fee,

46:47.765 --> 46:51.161
were all personal benefits to

46:51.193 --> 46:55.489
the Mayor of New Westminster. In reviewing the provisions

46:55.537 --> 46:59.121
of the Code of Conduct of the City of Guelph, I came

46:59.153 --> 47:02.481
to the exact same conclusion. And I indicated to

47:02.513 --> 47:06.089
Mayor Guthrie in a written response that

47:06.177 --> 47:09.769
while the statutory and other

47:09.857 --> 47:13.529
framework in B.C. was different from Ontario,

47:13.697 --> 47:16.721
the same essential rules applied.

47:16.873 --> 47:20.981
And therefore I indicated to the Mayor that I could not come to any

47:21.013 --> 47:24.877
other conclusion but that I believe that he had contravened

47:24.901 --> 47:28.957
the code of conduct. Shortly after

47:29.141 --> 47:33.077
I wrote my written advice to the mayor

47:33.141 --> 47:36.637
on November 9, I was made aware that a code of

47:36.701 --> 47:40.221
conduct complaint had been filed against the Mayor.

47:40.333 --> 47:43.613
I disclosed this to the mayor not. Not the

47:43.629 --> 47:47.173
actual complaint, but the fact that one had been filed.

47:47.269 --> 47:50.865
And I wrote to the complainant indicating that I had already

47:52.615 --> 47:56.383
commenced on a report as

47:56.439 --> 48:00.007
I was required to do under the provisions

48:00.031 --> 48:03.047
of the Code of Conduct of the City of Guelph. So,

48:03.231 --> 48:07.087
members of Council, what you have in front of you tonight is not

48:07.151 --> 48:10.471
an investigative report. It is a report

48:10.663 --> 48:14.663
based on the advice that I gave to Mayor Guthrie

48:14.799 --> 48:18.767
and the disclosure that he made to me. And my conclusions.

48:18.951 --> 48:22.385
My. My conclusions at the bottom are

48:22.425 --> 48:26.593
that the Mayor did, in receiving the

48:26.769 --> 48:29.873
hospitality that was offered by gcom,

48:29.969 --> 48:34.001
paid for by gcom, was in excess of what

48:34.033 --> 48:37.513
I thought was appropriate and it appeared to me to be a

48:37.529 --> 48:41.281
gift and benefit. I also indicated to him because

48:41.353 --> 48:45.505
he had told me that he was about to attend another

48:45.625 --> 48:49.361
summit, another conference put on by GCOM in Brazil.

48:49.513 --> 48:53.421
I indicated to him that I did not think it appropriate for him to do

48:53.453 --> 48:56.853
so. And I indicated to him that she. He should

48:56.909 --> 49:00.821
make a public disclosure of the fact. On the Monday

49:00.933 --> 49:04.181
on. Sorry, on the Tuesday. The Monday was Remembrance

49:04.253 --> 49:07.941
Day. On the Monday on the Tuesday I understood and senior

49:08.013 --> 49:11.725
staff have confirmed that the Mayor did disclose to senior staff

49:11.885 --> 49:15.181
that he had received the advice

49:15.293 --> 49:18.865
that he was canceling his trip to.

49:19.325 --> 49:22.701
To Brazil and that he made disclosure of the fact

49:22.733 --> 49:26.497
that I had indic that there was a breach of the code of conduct.

49:26.641 --> 49:30.257
So the mayor followed my advice to the

49:30.281 --> 49:33.761
team. I also provided recommendations

49:33.833 --> 49:37.073
to the mayor that if he wanted to. And I

49:37.089 --> 49:40.793
wasn't sure when he was going to Brazil or when he had planned to go

49:40.809 --> 49:44.161
to Brazil, but I indicated to him that if he still wanted

49:44.193 --> 49:47.273
to, there were several options available to him.

49:47.369 --> 49:50.681
And I suggested. I suggested them to

49:50.713 --> 49:54.793
him. Tonight on the Agenda. I understand that the mayor is seeking

49:54.929 --> 49:58.581
to move forward with one of the options that

49:58.653 --> 50:01.941
I had provided to him in

50:01.973 --> 50:05.141
my recommendations in my advice.

50:05.293 --> 50:08.885
So, counsel, my report is as

50:08.925 --> 50:13.045
it's set out. I'm happy to take questions. My conclusions

50:13.125 --> 50:16.901
are that I believe that the mayor is in contravention

50:16.933 --> 50:20.573
of the code. I believe that the mayor acted inadvertently.

50:20.709 --> 50:24.637
I believe he acted always in good faith and

50:24.661 --> 50:28.179
he was attempting to serve the better

50:28.267 --> 50:32.187
interest of the municipality, but may have just been misled

50:32.331 --> 50:35.755
in what he could accept from gcom,

50:35.835 --> 50:39.155
which was the accommodation, hospitality and

50:39.195 --> 50:42.723
travel expenses. The mayor accepted my.

50:42.819 --> 50:46.011
My report. In fact, I did write to the mayor and

50:46.043 --> 50:49.187
gave him an opportunity to review the report. And he

50:49.211 --> 50:52.735
said, I accept the report and I have no further comments to make.

50:53.145 --> 50:57.129
I believe the mayor has taken remedial steps by disclosing,

50:57.217 --> 51:00.601
publicly disclosing, the advice that I have given him or

51:00.673 --> 51:04.097
the substance of the advice by canceling his trip

51:04.201 --> 51:08.017
and by making efforts to move forward with

51:08.041 --> 51:11.561
the matter. So on the basis of all of

51:11.593 --> 51:15.465
that, I am not recommending that there be any penalty

51:15.545 --> 51:18.945
