56:08.935 --> 56:12.695
and local boards be amended to include an exemption for

56:12.735 --> 56:16.767
food, lodging, transportation and entertainment provided by third party organizations

56:16.831 --> 56:20.207
for attendance at events which are targeted to a municipal

56:20.271 --> 56:24.167
government audience. And when the total benefit exceeds 300,

56:24.311 --> 56:27.583
that required that requires reporting and the city council and

56:27.599 --> 56:30.075
local boards gift disclosure within 30 days.

56:30.905 --> 56:35.201
There also is a letter from the CEO

56:35.313 --> 56:39.673
