01:29:12.467 --> 01:29:16.251
rates to anyone that uses it in the city of Guelph.

01:29:16.443 --> 01:29:20.035
And the costs are allocated

01:29:20.115 --> 01:29:24.331
among the different classes of customers on a system basis.

01:29:24.523 --> 01:29:27.455
So there may be.

01:29:29.075 --> 01:29:32.507
It's uniform rates, but recovering all the costs that we incur.

01:29:32.611 --> 01:29:35.615
