01:32:26.921 --> 01:32:30.969
you can talk a bit about the other piece. Yeah. So the franchise agreement

01:32:31.017 --> 01:32:35.233
we're talking about is the regulated distribution utility

01:32:35.289 --> 01:32:38.841
here in Ontario. And we are regulated

01:32:38.873 --> 01:32:42.857
