01:38:54.515 --> 01:38:58.561
Hello, everyone. My name is Henry Moran and I am still

01:38:58.593 --> 01:39:02.385
a kid. And even though I'm still a kid, I've come to delegate here today

01:39:02.505 --> 01:39:06.405
because the climate crisis is a major problem that affects my generation.

01:39:06.985 --> 01:39:10.801
When I grow up, I don't want to have to worry about whether

01:39:10.953 --> 01:39:14.545
the air I'm breathing, the water I'm drinking, or the food I'm eating is clean

01:39:14.585 --> 01:39:17.889
or not. But I may have to because of the events

01:39:17.937 --> 01:39:21.449
going on right now. By subsidizing Enbridge, you're giving

01:39:21.497 --> 01:39:25.445
money to a company that may be part of making those nightmares a reality.

01:39:25.895 --> 01:39:29.199
Did you know that natural gas is one of Ontario's worst climate

01:39:29.287 --> 01:39:32.623
change contributors? It is responsible for a whole

01:39:32.679 --> 01:39:36.239
third of Ontario's greenhouse gas emissions. That may not

01:39:36.287 --> 01:39:40.103
sound like a lot, but consider that Ontario had 157

01:39:40.159 --> 01:39:43.795
megatons of carbon emissions back in 2022.

01:39:45.055 --> 01:39:48.631
That means companies like Enbridge are responsible for around 53

01:39:48.663 --> 01:39:52.363
megatons of carbon emissions themselves. Are you sure you want

01:39:52.379 --> 01:39:56.075
to keep giving money to a company? By deteriorating our air

01:39:56.115 --> 01:39:59.267
quality and relating that to what I said earlier.

01:39:59.411 --> 01:40:02.547
Adolescents around my age are going into depression and becoming

01:40:02.611 --> 01:40:05.411
incredibly anxious worrying about the future.

01:40:05.603 --> 01:40:08.755
Do you think we want to live in a world where we have to feel

01:40:08.795 --> 01:40:11.935
like we're overheating in both the summer and the winter?

01:40:12.915 --> 01:40:16.835
These problems are part of why 16% or more of

01:40:16.875 --> 01:40:20.095
adolescents are going into depression all around the world.

01:40:20.505 --> 01:40:23.845
And just like me, I'm guessing you aren't happy to hear those numbers.

01:40:24.185 --> 01:40:27.809
So you see, because we are giving money to the people indirectly

01:40:27.857 --> 01:40:31.857
causing mental illnesses in young people all around the world

01:40:32.001 --> 01:40:35.649
who are the future, might I add. We are just helping further the

01:40:35.697 --> 01:40:39.265
extent of the climate crisis. I'm not saying everything would be

01:40:39.305 --> 01:40:42.625
changed if we stopped subsidizing Enbridge, but it would help.

01:40:42.785 --> 01:40:46.257
