02:19:50.412 --> 02:19:53.504
Number five. Just sending a letter.

02:19:54.364 --> 02:19:57.744
Letters, plural. Okay. Nobody's against that.

02:19:58.164 --> 02:19:59.744
Okay. Sorry,

02:20:04.964 --> 02:20:07.588
Counselor. Alt will personally drive it around for everybody.

02:20:07.636 --> 02:20:10.695
Yeah. In his electric car, might I add.

02:20:11.875 --> 02:20:15.483
Okay. All right, that finishes that off. That item is now done.

02:20:15.539 --> 02:20:19.387
Thank you very much, everybody. I'm sorry,

02:20:19.491 --> 02:20:22.891
point of privilege. Yeah, yeah. So Councillor Gibson made

02:20:22.923 --> 02:20:26.427
an assertion that what is driving the cost of electricity and

02:20:26.451 --> 02:20:30.667
of utilities is the carbon tax. And we have no evidence of that.

02:20:30.811 --> 02:20:34.109
And in fact, we're aware that a lot of the utilities are in investing

02:20:34.157 --> 02:20:37.725
