02:20:37.885 --> 02:20:41.357
So I just like to state that I, as a counselor,

02:20:41.381 --> 02:20:44.225
and I think this body should not accept that as a fact.

02:20:47.165 --> 02:20:50.117
Yeah. Okay. I think that would be up to each of us to determine whether

02:20:50.141 --> 02:20:54.265
